{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-1111-4a2b-9c3d-oscar00000001",
    "name": "Diseno API - Vacuna, RegistroVacunacion, Adoptante",
    "description": "Diseno del API para los recursos a cargo de Oscar: Vacuna, RegistroVacunacion y Adoptante. Cada carpeta documenta las operaciones (findAll, findOne, create, update, delete), las representaciones basica y detallada, y los codigos de estado HTTP de cada una. Nota: 'CanalNotificacion' no aparece como recurso independiente porque en el modelo es una interfaz Strategy (no persistible); su unica huella en el API es el filtro 'canal' dentro del recurso /notificaciones.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Vacunas",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar vacunas (representacion basica)",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
            "pm.test(\"Respuesta es un arreglo\", function () { pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.be.an('array'); });"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/vacunas", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["vacunas"] },
            "description": "200 OK. Devuelve List<VacunaDTO>: id, nombre, descripcion (sin la coleccion de registros de vacunacion)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Consultar una vacuna (representacion detallada)",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/vacunas/{{vacunaId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["vacunas", "{{vacunaId}}"] },
            "description": "200 OK -> VacunaDTODetail (agrega registrosVacunacion).\n404 Not Found si el id no existe (ApiError con mensaje)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear vacuna",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test(\"Status code is 201\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Antirrabica\",\n  \"descripcion\": \"Vacuna anual contra la rabia\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/vacunas", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["vacunas"] },
            "description": "201 Created -> VacunaDTODetail.\n412 Precondition Failed si el nombre viene vacio o ya existe una vacuna con ese nombre."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Actualizar vacuna",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Antirrabica\",\n  \"descripcion\": \"Vacuna anual contra la rabia - refuerzo\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/vacunas/{{vacunaId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["vacunas", "{{vacunaId}}"] },
            "description": "200 OK -> VacunaDTODetail.\n404 Not Found si el id no existe.\n412 Precondition Failed si el nombre es invalido o esta duplicado."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Eliminar vacuna",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test(\"Status code is 204\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(204); });"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/vacunas/{{vacunaId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["vacunas", "{{vacunaId}}"] },
            "description": "204 No Content.\n404 Not Found si el id no existe.\n412 Precondition Failed si la vacuna tiene registros de vacunacion asociados."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Registros de Vacunacion",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar registros de vacunacion (representacion basica)",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/registros-vacunacion", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["registros-vacunacion"] },
            "description": "200 OK. Devuelve List<RegistroVacunacionDTO>: incluye fechaAplicacion, proximaFecha, numeroLote, observacion y las asociaciones de cardinalidad 1 (vacuna, mascota, seguimientoOrigen)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Consultar un registro de vacunacion (representacion detallada)",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/registros-vacunacion/{{registroId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["registros-vacunacion", "{{registroId}}"] },
            "description": "200 OK -> RegistroVacunacionDTODetail.\n404 Not Found si el id no existe."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear registro de vacunacion",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test(\"Status code is 201\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"fechaAplicacion\": \"2026-01-15\",\n  \"proximaFecha\": \"2027-01-15\",\n  \"numeroLote\": \"LOTE-2026-01\",\n  \"observacion\": \"Sin reacciones adversas\",\n  \"vacuna\": { \"id\": 1 },\n  \"mascota\": { \"id\": 1 }\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/registros-vacunacion", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["registros-vacunacion"] },
            "description": "201 Created -> RegistroVacunacionDTODetail.\n404 Not Found si la vacuna o la mascota indicadas no existen.\n412 Precondition Failed si faltan datos obligatorios o la fecha de aplicacion es futura / la proxima fecha no es posterior."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Actualizar registro de vacunacion",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"fechaAplicacion\": \"2026-01-15\",\n  \"proximaFecha\": \"2027-02-01\",\n  \"numeroLote\": \"LOTE-2026-01\",\n  \"observacion\": \"Se ajusta proxima fecha\",\n  \"vacuna\": { \"id\": 1 },\n  \"mascota\": { \"id\": 1 }\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/registros-vacunacion/{{registroId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["registros-vacunacion", "{{registroId}}"] },
            "description": "200 OK -> RegistroVacunacionDTODetail.\n404 Not Found si el registro, la vacuna o la mascota no existen.\n412 Precondition Failed si los datos no son validos."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Eliminar registro de vacunacion",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test(\"Status code is 204\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(204); });"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/registros-vacunacion/{{registroId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["registros-vacunacion", "{{registroId}}"] },
            "description": "204 No Content.\n404 Not Found si el id no existe."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
